"In order to build Nix for a different platform than the one you're currently "
"on, you need a way for your current Nix installation to build code for that "
"platform. Common solutions include \\[remote build machines\\] and [binary "
"format emulation](https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/stable/options.html#opt-"
"boot.binfmt.emulatedSystems) (only supported on NixOS)."
msgstr ""

