#: source/development/building.md:223
msgid ""
"When cross-compiling Nix with Meson for local development, you need to "
"specify a [cross-file](https://mesonbuild.com/Cross-compilation.html) using "
"the `--cross-file` option. Cross-files define the target architecture and "
"toolchain. When cross-compiling Nix with Nix, Nixpkgs takes care of this for "
"you."
